# ===========================================
*.log
logs/
log/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
lerna-debug.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# 运行时数据
pids
*.pid
*.seed
*.pid.lock

# ===========================================
